 "description": "Food-derived medium: metabolizable components of Pacific ocean perch (Sebastes alutus) [Aquatic foods] from FooDB, plus a standard M9 mineral base. Organic components use presence-based uptake bounds; FooDB content retained. Measured compounds with no BiGG exchange are listed under uncovered.",
